#. what Grandmother says when all the animals are home; {rider} is the rider's name
#: data/levels/02_after_the_storm.tscn
#, fuzzy
msgid "Thank you, {rider}! All our sheep are home after the storm."
msgstr "Спасибо, {rider}! После бури все наши овцы дома."

#. what a person says to the rider, at most two short sentences; {rider} is her name
#: data/levels/02_after_the_storm.tscn
#, fuzzy
msgid "The storm scattered our sheep, {rider}! Please find them."
msgstr "Буря разогнала наших овец, {rider}! Пожалуйста, найди их."

