#. what a person says to the rider, at most two short sentences; {rider} is her name
#: data/levels/02_after_the_storm.tscn
#, fuzzy
msgid "Good day, {rider}! I saw one of your sheep."
msgstr "Добрый день, {rider}! Я видел одну из твоих овец."

#. the name of a level, a few words
#: data/levels/03_grandmothers_camel.tscn
#, fuzzy
msgid "Grandmother's camel"
