#. what Grandmother says when all the animals are home; {rider} is the rider's name
#: data/levels/03_grandmothers_camel.tscn
#, fuzzy
msgid "Thank you, {rider}! My camel is home, and the sheep too."
msgstr "Спасибо, {rider}! Мой верблюд дома, и овцы тоже."

#. what a person says to the rider, at most two short sentences; {rider} is her name
#: data/levels/03_grandmothers_camel.tscn
#, fuzzy
msgid "My old camel wandered far away, {rider}. Listen: you will hear it before you see it!"
msgstr "Мой старый верблюд ушёл далеко, {rider}. Слушай: ты услышишь его раньше, чем увидишь!"

#. what a person says to the rider, at most two short sentences; {rider} is her name
#: data/levels/03_grandmothers_camel.tscn
#, fuzzy
msgid "Hello, {rider}! Two sheep came to drink at my well."
msgstr "Привет, {rider}! Две овцы пришли попить к моему колодцу."

#. the name of a level, a few words
#: data/levels/04_the_foals.tscn
#, fuzzy
