#. what Grandmother says when all the animals are home; {rider} is the rider's name
#: data/levels/04_the_foals.tscn
#, fuzzy
msgid "Thank you, {rider}! The foals are home with their mothers."
msgstr "Спасибо, {rider}! Жеребята дома, со своими мамами."

#. what a person says to the rider, at most two short sentences; {rider} is her name
#: data/levels/04_the_foals.tscn
#, fuzzy
msgid "The foals ran off, {rider}. Ride slowly to them, or they run away!"
msgstr "Жеребята убежали, {rider}. Подъезжай к ним медленно, а то они убегут!"

