#. what Grandmother says when all the animals are home; {rider} is the rider's name
#: data/levels/06_along_the_esil.tscn
#, fuzzy
msgid "Thank you, {rider}! Everyone is back across the Esil."
msgstr "Спасибо, {rider}! Все вернулись из-за Есиля."

#. what a person says to the rider, at most two short sentences; {rider} is her name
#: data/levels/06_along_the_esil.tscn
#, fuzzy
msgid "Our animals crossed the Esil, {rider}. Cross only at the fords, where the water is shallow!"
msgstr "Наши животные перешли Есиль, {rider}. Переправляйся только по бродам, где мелко!"

#. what a person says to the rider, at most two short sentences; {rider} is her name
#: data/levels/06_along_the_esil.tscn
#, fuzzy
msgid "Good day, {rider}! Two sheep went over the river."
msgstr "Добрый день, {rider}! Две овцы ушли за реку."

#. what a person says to the rider, at most two short sentences; {rider} is her name
#: data/levels/06_along_the_esil.tscn
#, fuzzy
msgid "Hello, {rider}! Your horses graze on my side of the river."
msgstr "Привет, {rider}! Твои лошади пасутся на моём берегу реки."

#. the name of a level, a few words
#: data/levels/07_the_salt_lake.tscn
#, fuzzy
msgid "The salt lake"
msgstr "Солёное озеро"

#. what Grandmother says when all the animals are home; {rider} is the rider's name
#: data/levels/07_the_salt_lake.tscn
#, fuzzy
msgid "Thank you, {rider}! You rode across the whole salt steppe!"
msgstr "Спасибо, {rider}! Ты проехала всю солончаковую степь!"

#. what a person says to the rider, at most two short sentences; {rider} is her name
#: data/levels/07_the_salt_lake.tscn
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Our camels went towards the salt lake, {rider}. Its water is too salty, so let your horse drink "
"elsewhere!"
msgstr ""
"Наши верблюды ушли к солёному озеру, {rider}. Его вода слишком солёная: пусть твоя лошадь пьёт в "
"другом месте!"

#. what a person says to the rider, at most two short sentences; {rider} is her name
#: data/levels/07_the_salt_lake.tscn
#, fuzzy
msgid "Good day, {rider}! I saw sheep far in the east."
msgstr "Добрый день, {rider}! Я видел овец далеко на востоке."

#. what a person says to the rider, at most two short sentences; {rider} is her name
#: data/levels/07_the_salt_lake.tscn
#, fuzzy
msgid "Hello, {rider}! Horses run between the rock and the bushes."
msgstr "Привет, {rider}! Между камнем и кустами бегают лошади."

#. the name of a level, a few words
#: data/levels/08_the_herders_request.tscn
#, fuzzy
msgid "The herder's request"
