#. what Grandmother says when all the animals are home; {rider} is the rider's name
#: data/levels/09_autumn_migration.tscn
#, fuzzy
msgid "Thank you, {rider}! The whole herd is ready for the winter pastures."
msgstr "Спасибо, {rider}! Всё стадо готово идти на зимние пастбища."

#. what a person says to the rider, at most two short sentences; {rider} is her name
#: data/levels/09_autumn_migration.tscn
#, fuzzy
msgid "Autumn has come, {rider}. We move to the winter pastures, but our animals are scattered!"
msgstr "Пришла осень, {rider}. Мы откочёвываем на зимовье, а наши животные разбрелись!"

#. what a person says to the rider, at most two short sentences; {rider} is her name
#: data/levels/09_autumn_migration.tscn
#, fuzzy
msgid "Good day, {rider}! I saw camels and horses on my way."
msgstr "Добрый день, {rider}! По дороге я видел верблюдов и лошадей."

